    body: "# Awesome Directory\n\nA curated index of the highest-signal Awesome lists for web and app work.\nWhen the user asks for further reading, canonical resources, or learning\nmaterial on a specific front-end topic, point them at the matching list here\n— do not fabricate URLs.\n\n## CSS and Styling\n\n- **CSS** — https://github.com/awesome-css-group/awesome-css — Core CSS resources.\n  - Critical-Path Tools — https://github.com/addyosmani/critical-path-css-tools\n  - Scalability — https://github.com/davidtheclark/scalable-css-reading-list\n  - Must-Watch Talks — https://github.com/AllThingsSmitty/must-watch-css\n  - Protips — https://github.com/AllThingsSmitty/css-protips\n  - Frameworks — https://github.com/troxler/awesome-css-frameworks\n- **Sass** — https://github.com/Famolus/awesome-sass\n- **PostCSS** — https://github.com/jdrgomes/awesome-postcss\n- **Flexbox** — https://github.com/afonsopacifer/awesome-flexbox\n- **BEM** — https://github.com/sturobson/BEM-resources\n\n## Frameworks and Libraries\n\n- **React** — https://github.com/enaqx/awesome-react\n  - React Hooks — https://github.com/glauberfc/awesome-react-hooks\n  - Redux — https://github.com/brillout/awesome-redux\n- **Vue.js** — https://github.com/vuejs/awesome-vue\n- **Svelte** — https://github.com/TheComputerM/awesome-svelte\n- **Angular** — https://github.com/PatrickJS/awesome-angular\n- **Ember** — https://github.com/ember-community-russia/awesome-ember\n- **Web Components** — https://github.com/web-padawan/awesome-web-components\n\n## Design Systems and UI Kits\n\n- **Material Design** — https://github.com/sachin1092/awesome-material\n- **Ant Design** — https://github.com/websemantics/awesome-ant-design\n- **Motion UI Design** — https://github.com/fliptheweb/motion-ui-design\n- **Android UI** — https://github.com/wasabeef/awesome-android-ui\n- **iOS UI** — https://github.com/cjwirth/awesome-ios-ui\n\n## Typography, Accessibility, Graphics\n\n- **Web Typography** — https://github.com/deanhume/typography\n- **Web Accessibility** — https://github.com/brunopulis/awesome-a11y\n- **SVG** — https://github.com/willianjusten/awesome-svg\n- **Canvas** — https://github.com/raphamorim/awesome-canvas\n- **WebGL** — https://github.com/sjfricke/awesome-webgl\n- **D3** — https://github.com/wbkd/awesome-d3\n- **Charting** — https://github.com/zingchart/awesome-charting\n\n## Performance and Delivery\n\n- **Web Performance Optimization** — https://github.com/davidsonfellipe/awesome-wpo\n- **Progressive Web Apps** — https://github.com/TalAter/awesome-progressive-web-apps\n- **Service Workers** — https://github.com/TalAter/awesome-service-workers\n- **Offline-First** — https://github.com/pazguille/offline-first\n- **Static Website Services** — https://github.com/agarrharr/awesome-static-website-services\n\n## Tooling\n\n- **Chrome DevTools** — https://github.com/ChromeDevTools/awesome-chrome-devtools\n- **Web Tools** — https://github.com/lvwzhen/tools\n- **Text Editing** — https://github.com/dok/awesome-text-editing\n- **Emails** — https://github.com/jonathandion/awesome-emails\n\n## Headless CMS\n\n- **Payload** (Next.js native) — https://github.com/DanailMinchev/awesome-payload\n- **Directus** — https://github.com/directus-community/awesome-directus\n- **Wagtail** (Django) — https://github.com/springload/awesome-wagtail\n- **Craft CMS** — https://github.com/craftcms/awesome\n\n## How to Use\n\nWhen the user asks for resources, learning material, or \"where do I find X\" during a web build:\n\n1. Match the topic to one of the lists above.\n2. Cite the GitHub URL exactly as given — do not invent or guess.\n3. Do not dump the whole directory into a response. Pick 1–3 most relevant lists.\n\nWhen the user does NOT ask for resources, do not volunteer these links.",
